return {h=8,w=75,cr=255,hc=15,bh=70,gr="medium",eg={"flying"},st={40,45,35,30,40,55},ab={{39,0},{151,1}},genus={en="Bat Pokémon",es="Pokémon Murciélago",pt="Pokémon Morcego"},flavor={en={[1]="Forms colonies in perpetually dark places. Uses ultrasonic waves to identify and approach targets.",[2]="Forms colonies in perpetually dark places. Uses ultrasonic waves to identify and approach targets.",[3]="Emits ultrasonic cries while it flies. They act as a sonar used to check for objects in its way.",[4]="While flying, it constantly emits ultrasonic waves from its mouth to check its surroundings.",[5]="Capable of flying safely in dark places, it emits ultrasonic cries to check for any obstacles.",[6]="During the day, it gathers with others and hangs from the ceilings of old buildings and caves.",[7]="ZUBAT remains quietly unmoving in a dark spot during the bright daylight hours. It does so because prolonged exposure to the sun causes its body to become slightly burned.",[8]="ZUBAT avoids sunlight because exposure causes it to become unhealthy. During the daytime, it stays in caves or under the eaves of old houses, sleeping while hanging upside down.",[9]="While living in pitch-black caverns, their eyes gradually grew shut and deprived them of vision. They use ultrasonic waves to detect obstacles.",[10]="It has no eyes. Instead, it relies on its ultrasonic cries for echo location to flit about in darkness.",[11]="It forms colonies in perpetually dark places and uses ultrasonic waves to identify and approach targets.",[12]="Even though it has no eyes, it can sense obstacles using ultrasonic waves it emits from its mouth.",[13]="Disliking sunlight, it sleeps deep in forests and caves until sundown.",[14]="It checks its surroundings and location using reflections of the ultrasonic waves from its mouth.",[15]="While flying, it constantly emits ultrasonic waves from its mouth to check its surroundings.",[16]="Capable of flying safely in dark places, it emits ultrasonic cries to check for any obstacles.",[17]="It checks its surroundings and location using reflections of the ultrasonic waves from its mouth.",[18]="It checks its surroundings and location using reflections of the ultrasonic waves from its mouth.",[21]="It does not need eyes, because it emits ultrasonic waves to check its surroundings while it flies.",[22]="It does not need eyes, because it emits ultrasonic waves to check its surroundings while it flies.",[23]="Even though it has no eyes, it can sense obstacles using ultrasonic waves it emits from its mouth.",[24]="It has no eyes. Instead, it relies on its ultrasonic cries for echolocation to flit about in darkness.",[25]="Zubat remains quietly unmoving in a dark spot during the bright daylight hours. It does so because prolonged exposure to the sun causes its body to become slightly burned.",[26]="Zubat avoids sunlight because exposure causes it to become unhealthy. During the daytime, it stays in caves or under the eaves of old houses, sleeping while hanging upside down.",[27]="It sleeps in caves during the day. It has no eyes, so to check its surroundings while flying, it emits ultrasonic waves.",[28]="When exposed to sunlight, they suffer burns. The frequency of their ultrasonic waves can differ slightly from colony to colony.",[29]="It has no eyeballs, so it can’t see. It checks its surroundings via the ultrasonic waves it emits from its mouth.",[30]="Their skin is so thin that they’ll be burned if sunlight hits them. When it gets cold out, they gather together to warm one another’s bodies.",[31]="Emits ultrasonic cries while it flies. They act as a sonar used to check for objects in its way.",[32]="Emits ultrasonic cries while it flies. They act as a sonar used to check for objects in its way.",[33]="It emits ultrasonic waves from its mouth to check its surroundings. Even in tight caves, Zubat flies around with skill.",[34]="Zubat live in caves, down where the sun’s light won’t reach. In the morning, they gather together to keep each other warm as they sleep.",[39]="Makes its home in gloomy caves. Atrophied eyes have left this Pokémon blind, so it scans its surroundings via sound waves that it emits from its mouth as it flies."},es={[23]="Aunque carezca de ojos, puede detectar obstáculos con las ondas ultrasónicas que emite su boca.",[24]="No tiene ojos. Se guía por las ondas ultrasónicas que emite. El eco le indica por dónde tiene que ir en la oscuridad.",[25]="Durante el día, Zubat permanece inmóvil y a oscuras. Si este Pokémon pasara mucho tiempo expuesto al sol, correría el peligro de sufrir quemaduras.",[26]="Zubat evita la luz del día porque le resulta perjudicial para la salud. Durante el día, permanece en cuevas o bajo los aleros de las casas viejas durmiendo colgado de las patas, cabeza abajo.",[27]="Duerme en cuevas durante el día. Como no tiene ojos, se guía emitiendo ultrasonidos cuando vuela.",[28]="Si se expone al sol, puede sufrir quemaduras. La vibración de las ondas ultrasónicas que emite varía, curiosamente, de una colonia a otra.",[29]="Como carece de ojos y no puede ver, emite ultrasonidos que le permiten escrutar el entorno y orientarse.",[30]="Su piel es tan fina que, si se expone al sol, puede sufrir quemaduras. Cuando hace frío, se junta con los suyos para entrar en calor.",[31]="Emite ultrasonidos que utiliza como sonar para evitar obstáculos cuando vuela.",[32]="Emite ultrasonidos que utiliza como sonar para evitar obstáculos cuando vuela.",[33]="Emite ondas ultrasónicas por la boca para escrutar el entorno, lo que le permite volar con pericia por cuevas angostas.",[34]="Habitan en cuevas donde no llegan los rayos del sol. De día, se acurrucan unos junto a otros para entrar en calor mientras duermen."},pt="Vive em cavernas escuras. Seus olhos atrofiados o deixaram cego, então ele examina os arredores com ondas sonoras que emite pela boca enquanto voa."},evo={{s=41},{s=42,from=41,c={{t="level-up",lv=22}}},{s=169,from=42,c={{t="level-up",happy=160}}}},moves=